  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Some extra bindings are probably needed for those of us that wish to recreate the non-advanced vive controls from live. Calling this \"Simple Vive\" for simplicity. \n\nSimple Vive's click movement controls can be achieved by removing `continue_move` from trackpad touch but gesture control can't be fully replicated. With simple Vive, gestures selected with the touchpad will remain until a new one is selected but gestures selected with the trigger or grip will switch to neutral upon release.",
